      "## Using weights correctly",
      "The weights show how the scored examination is distributed. They do not mean that low-weight domains can be ignored. A candidate who neglects Core Counseling Attributes may also miss questions in Counseling Skills and Interventions because empathy, alliance, and attending skills overlap with intervention work.",
